WHAT THIS LICENSE DOES NOT COVER
--------------------------------
Material in this repository that belongs to other people stays under its own
terms.  It is kept here for study, reference and fidelity testing only, and is
not licensed, sublicensed or redistributed by this license:

  - mstp/MultiScaleTruchetPatterns.wl
    mstp/MultiScaleTruchetPatternExamples.nb
        Christopher Carlson's original Wolfram Language source and examples.
  - truchet_page.html, truchet_page2.html, truchet_text.txt, mstp.zip
        saved copies of Carlson's published article / package download.
  - ref_*.png, carlson_cells_sheet.png, mstp_full_raw.png, truchet_carlson_g1.png
        Carlson's published images (and crops/zooms of them) used as visual
        references.

The engine in src/engine.js is an independent reimplementation, written in
JavaScript, of the geometry and algorithm Carlson publishes.  It is not a
translation of his source file, and no code from his file is copied into it.

